(A. DIAGNOSE THE COMPUTATIONAL BOTTLENECK) Tj
50 606.0 Td
(==========================================) Tj
50 593.0 Td
(  Original algorithm: Exhaustive enumeration of all 2^n subsets.) Tj
50 580.0 Td
() Tj
50 567.0 Td
(  WHERE most effort is spent:) Tj
50 554.0 Td
(    - The outer loop iterates 2^n times.) Tj
50 541.0 Td
(    - For each iteration: n bit-checks to decode the subset.) Tj
50 528.0 Td
(    - Total operations: n * 2^n) Tj
50 515.0 Td
() Tj
50 502.0 Td
(  WHICH operation grows most:) Tj
50 489.0 Td
(    - 2^n growth per package added. Adding ONE package DOUBLES all work.) Tj
50 476.0 Td
(    - For n=25 -> n=30: work increases 32-fold.) Tj
50 463.0 Td
() Tj
50 450.0 Td
(  WHETHER work is repeated:) Tj
50 437.0 Td
(    - YES. Subsets share large common prefixes.) Tj
50 424.0 Td
(    - Subset {P1, P2, P5} and {P1, P2, P6} both re-compute weight\({P1,P2}\).) Tj
50 411.0 Td
(    - This shared prefix is recomputed for EVERY subset that starts with P1,P2.) Tj
50 398.0 Td
() Tj
50 385.0 Td
(  CHARACTERISTIC CAUSING LIMITATION:) Tj
50 372.0 Td
(    - Blind enumeration: every subset is evaluated independently.) Tj
50 359.0 Td
(    - No pruning: infeasible subsets \(weight > W\) are still fully decoded.) Tj
50 346.0 Td
(    - No memory: previously computed partial sums are discarded.) Tj
50 333.0 Td
() Tj
50 320.0 Td
() Tj
50 307.0 Td
(B. DEFINE THE DESIGN OBJECTIVE) Tj
50 294.0 Td
(================================) Tj
50 281.0 Td
(  Primary objective:) Tj
50 268.0 Td
(    AVOID evaluating subsets that are provably infeasible.) Tj
50 255.0 Td
() Tj
50 242.0 Td
(  Specific measurable goals:) Tj
50 229.0 Td
(    1. Prune branches when partial weight already exceeds W.) Tj
50 216.0 Td
(    2. Reuse previously computed partial sums \(memoisation or DP table\).) Tj
50 203.0 Td
(    3. Reduce the number of subsets fully evaluated from 2^n to significantly less.) Tj
50 190.0 Td
() Tj
50 177.0 Td
() Tj
50 164.0 Td
(C. REDESIGN: BRANCH-AND-BOUND WITH GREEDY BOUND) Tj
50 151.0 Td
(=================================================) Tj
50 138.0 Td
(  Key insight: If we build solutions incrementally \(item by item\), we can) Tj
50 125.0 Td
(  PRUNE entire branches when:) Tj
50 112.0 Td
(    \(a\) Current weight + remaining minimum weight > W, OR) Tj
50 99.0 Td
(    \(b\) Current value + upper bound on remaining value <= best found so far.) Tj
50 86.0 Td
() Tj
50 73.0 Td
(  Upper bound function \(Greedy fractional relaxation\):) Tj
ET
