(WHAT CHANGED:) Tj
50 652.0 Td
(  - Instead of iterating all 2^n subsets independently, we EXPLORE a tree.) Tj
50 639.0 Td
(  - Each node represents a partial decision \(include/exclude each item\).) Tj
50 626.0 Td
(  - We PRUNE branches where the BEST POSSIBLE outcome is <= current best.) Tj
50 613.0 Td
(  - Sorting by value/weight ratio maximises early pruning effectiveness.) Tj
50 600.0 Td
(  - Shared prefixes are computed ONCE along the recursion path \(not repeated\).) Tj
50 587.0 Td
() Tj
50 574.0 Td
() Tj
